--- !u!114 &1258484376
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1258484375}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d6e926151a8fc5d4c8db9a1f458d22f5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BRATGUIStoryIntro
  chapters:
  - title: The grave
    narration: In Odium, the dead were once given silence. Now even their graves
      whisper. Beside the last person she could not save, an archer swore that no
      more names would be surrendered to the dark.
    illustration: {fileID: 679726451}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 1053747926}
      travel: {x: -40, y: 15}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 2011069780}
      travel: {x: 20, y: -5}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: What answered
    narration: The first hunters followed those whispers beneath the chapel. Something
      waited there, clothed in the shapes of their fears. Steel could wound it. Steel
      alone could not make it stay dead.
    illustration: {fileID: 1998087928}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 172419985}
      travel: {x: -60, y: -10}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 571956160}
      travel: {x: 70, y: 5}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: The last watch
    narration: When the watchfires failed, a few still held the heights. Their armour
      was broken; their names were forgotten. They kept the road open for those who
      had nowhere left to flee.
    illustration: {fileID: 1938245822}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 211331134}
      travel: {x: -45, y: 15}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: The oath
    narration: In a ruined shrine, a knight laid his sword before a dying flame.
      He asked for no crown, no forgiveness. Only the strength to stand when the
      next door opened.
    illustration: {fileID: 1972389510}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 1748155130}
      travel: {x: 15, y: -5}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 236244385}
      travel: {x: -35, y: 10}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: The road in
    narration: A ranger and his hound found the trail the living had abandoned. Beyond
      the black pines stood the old keep. Beneath it lay the source of the voices.
      One by one, the survivors took the same road.
    illustration: {fileID: 428398984}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 1958429507}
      travel: {x: -35, y: 10}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 1988254084}
      travel: {x: 25, y: -5}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  - title: Before the dawn
    narration: At the gate, the thing from the graves rose to meet them. This time,
      no one faced it alone. They had come to reclaim their dead, and to learn what
      the darkness would demand in return.
    illustration: {fileID: 419668754}
    layers:
    - image: {fileID: 1211485886}
      travel: {x: 60, y: -5}
      finalScale: 1
    - image: {fileID: 486327601}
      travel: {x: -60, y: 5}
      finalScale: 1
    travel: {x: 0, y: 0}
    finalScale: 1
    extraReadingTime: 0
  canvasRect: {fileID: 1258484380}
